==Trivia==
* This is the first Japanese opening featuring humans to not feature {{Ash}}.
* This is the first Japanese opening not to be used in any [[dub]], as the Asian dubs which had previously retained the Japanese opening replaced it with [[We Go|We Go (English Ver.)]]<!--, or [[Set Sail]] in mainland China-->.
* Among the first opening songs of all [[series]], Heart-Throbbing Diary has been used in the least amount of episodes before being replaced, at 23 episodes.

===Errors===
* In [[HZ002]], the middle section of [[Mollie]]'s jacket's left sleeve was incorrectly colored gray instead of red when she turns around to look at Liko. This was corrected in [[HZ003]].

